---
import { Image, getImage } from "astro:assets";
import hand from "../assets/images/hand.svg";
import bg from "../assets/images/bg-about.webp";

const optimizedBg = await getImage({ src: bg });
---

<section id="about" class="about" style={`--bgUrl: url(${optimizedBg.src});`}>
  <h2>About</h2>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="img">
      <Image src={hand} alt="" role="presentation" />
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        Passage Gathering has proven to be - in both name and effect - a
        catalyst moment. It was created in 2020 as a manifestation of love and a
        determination to emerge from the cocoon of isolation healthier and more
        connected to self and friends. The Covid threat was waning, and we
        needed to be together. That sweet togetherness combined with a
        collective intention to turn the page to a new era defined - and still
        defines - the Passage experience as it continues to grow. We hope the
        experiences had on this beautiful 60 acres are an emergence of spirit
        for you as they have been for so many during the first 5 years of
        Passage.
      </p>
      <p>
        From joyful, ecstatic house music to deeply tribal rhythms from beyond
        the bounds of time, we use sound as a catalyst for it all. Join us and
        see what unfolds in what is becoming one of the most beloved dance music
        events in our part of the world.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .about {
    background: var(--bgUrl) center center no-repeat;
    background-size: cover;
    color: var(--color-light-gold);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);

    @media (min-width: #{utils.getBreakpoint('lg')}) {
      background-attachment: fixed;
    }

    &::before {
      content: "";
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 1;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
  }

  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;

    @media (min-width: #{utils.getBreakpoint('lg')}) {
      display: flex;
      gap: 75px;

      .img {
        width: 321px;
      }

      .content {
        flex: 1;
      }
    }
  }

  h2 {
    color: white;
  }

  .img {
    width: 30vw;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  p {
    color: white;
  }
</style>
